# Build context is the workspace root (needed: pnpm manifests + packages/ +
# apps/web + benchmarks). Everything below is regenerated in the image or
# irrelevant to the runtime build, so keep it out of the context to keep the
# build fast and deterministic.
**/node_modules
**/build
**/dist
**/.maxstack
**/.turbo
**/.react-router
.git
docs
dogfood/change-log*.jsonl
*.log
